            "review_title": "Review at Optimist Casual Cafe",
            "review_text": "Евгений Г\nNha Trang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nDisgusting service.\nMar 2024 • Family\nIf you want to eat well, then choose another establishment. Here your order will definitely be forgotten. Hot dishes are prepared within 20-30 minutes. This is the third time that only salmon steak is available. Okay, my wife ordered a salad and a pastrami sandwich, I ordered a salmon steak. After 40 minutes, the steak was still not cooked, although when ordering, the waiter asked again 3 times and said that it would be necessary to wait a long time. Food 3, service 0 - I will never back to this cafe.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nAsk about your order every 5 minutes.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 18, 2024",
